  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（──出会った時は、公園で歌ってたんだよなぁ……\r\n人前でも、堂々と歌えるようになって……）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001002010020,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "──はい、ありがとうございましたっ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100201/1001002010020"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0243",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1500
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "お疲れ様、次の曲を録るまで少し休憩だな\r\n……ほら、差し入れがあるぞ",
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "charType": "characters",
    "charId": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1001002010030,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "お疲れさまですっ\r\n──ほわぁ、たい焼き……っ",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100201/1001002010030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "真乃から選んでほしいって、スタッフさんからのご厚意だ\r\nどれがいい？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "つぶあん、こしあん、白あん、クリーム……\r\n後はおかず系の──チーズたまごもあるそうだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001002010040,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "そ、そんなに種類が……っ\r\nど、どうしよう……っ",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_trouble",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100201/1001002010040"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001002010050,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "どれも美味しそうで──……\r\nほわ……っ、は、早く決めないとですよねっ……",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100201/1001002010050"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001002010060,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "えっと、えぇっと……っ",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100201/1001002010060"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001002010070,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "プロデューサーさん、すみませんっ……\r\nどれも美味しそうで、ひとつに決められなくて──",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100201/1001002010070"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001002010080,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "みなさんに決めてもらってから──……\r\n最後に、私の番にしてもらえないでしょうか……？",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100201/1001002010080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──っ、はは……！\r\nやっぱりまわりのことを考えちゃうんだな……！",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad_s2",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001002010090,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "え……？",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100201/1001002010090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、ごめん。真乃らしいと思ったんだよ\r\n……真乃は、癒しのアイドルだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001002010100,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "ほわ……前にも、そう言っていただきましたね……\r\nまだ、実感はないままですけど──",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100201/1001002010100"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001002010110,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "もし私がみなさんを癒せてるなら……\r\nそれはやっぱり、間違いなくうれしいですっ",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100201/1001002010110"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001002010120,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "……プロデューサーさんにそう言ってもらえると、\r\nポカポカしてきちゃいます",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100201/1001002010120"
  },
  {
    "charLabel": "mano",
